J0019,Q01,How is the CGTMSE guarantee fee calculated after April 2025?,R-CG-C-407,Scheme document योजना दस्तावेज़,III. ANNUAL GUARANTEE FEE > 8. Annual Guarantee Fee (AGF),"8. Annual Guarantee Fee (AGF)
