institution availing of the guarantee within 30 days from the date of first
disbursement of credit facility (not applicable for Working capital) or
30 days from the date of Demand Advi ce (CGDAN) of guarantee fee
whichever is later or such date as specified by the Trust.
(ii) The Annual Guarantee fee (subsequent to first time fee) at specified
rate (as specified above) on pro-rata basis for the first and last year
and in full for the intervening years would be generated by first week
of February every year. AGF so demanded would be paid by the MLIs
on or before 30 th March each year or any other specified date by
CGTMSE, of every year.
