J0115,Q03,maximum CGTMSE guarantee cover per borrower,R-CG-C-319,View,III. SCOPE AND EXTENT OF THE SCHEME > 13. Extent of the Guarantee Goverage,"13. Extent of the Guarantee Goverage
Graded Guarantee Cover
Guarantee provided will be a portfolio level guarantee by CGTMSE. All loans given by each
Lender under the scheme will be considered as part of one portfolio and the guarantee
coverage on the portfolio will be as following:
. 10O% guarantee cover up to first 5% loss of the portfolio amount covered under the
guarantee.
