per borrower subject to ceiling amount of individual MLI or such amount as may be
specified by the Trust shall also be eligible for coverage under the scheme.
The guarantee cover will commence from the guarantee start date and shall run
through the agreed tenure of the term credit in respect of term credit / composite
credit.
