Kind Attention: SME/Priority Sector Department
Circular No.151/2018–19
Madam /Dear Sir,
Modification in the eligibility criteria of Credit Guarantee Scheme (CGS)
As per CGTMSE Scheme guidelines, Chapter 2: Scope and Extent of the Scheme point
no. 4 (i) a credit facility is eligible under the scheme provided that as on material date the dues
to the lending institution have not become bad or doubtful of recovery. However, it has been
observed that this has caused misinterpretation in the definition of the eligibility criteria of credit
facility, as the MLIs may cover SMA / NPA assets under the Credit Guarantee Scheme.
Therefore, it has been decided to consider the definition of the Standard Asset as per RBI
guidelines and modify the point no. 4 (i) of chapter 2 of the Scheme guidelines as;
