28.07.2026, out of total of 2,56,892 application s amounting Rs. 55,244.26 crore filed since
30.10.2017 by Micro and Small Enterprises (MSEs), a total of 90,793 cases involving amount of Rs.
21,038 crore are at various stages of adjudication with MSE Facilitation Councils.
