J0595,Q13,tax deduction for payments to MSE suppliers made late,R-GST-C-109,View,"Part > 50. Interest on delayed payment of tax. > 2.5 Rule 88B of the CGST Rules, 2017 provides for the","case, where the  supplies made during a  tax period are declared by the  registered
