As per government directives, all corporates with a turnover of ₹250 crore and above are mandated to complete
TReDS Registration
. They must register on any RBI-approved
TReDS Platform
, such as
M1xchange TReDS
, to enable their MSME suppliers to access timely payments. This mandate ensures financial inclusion and better liquidity for small businesses.
