TReDS Online
ensures speed, transparency, and reduced credit risk. With easy
TReDS Registration Online
, MSMEs can improve cash flow, avoid delayed payments, and maintain healthy operations.
TReDS Login
enables real-time tracking and faster settlements. Overall, the
TReDS Platform
empowers MSMEs with financial independence and growth opportunities, strengthening their role in national supply chains.
What are the registration fees and ongoing charges?
To register on
M1xchange TReDS
, participants are required to pay a one-time, non-refundable
TReDS Registration
fee. This applies at the time of onboarding and is standard across all users. Post-registration, the ongoing transaction charges may vary based on your business arrangement and the corporate buyer you're linked to. These charges are determined by the commercial terms between buyers and sellers on the
TReDS Platform
. Once onboarded, users can manage transactions via the
TReDS Portal
and
TReDS Login
. For complete details, refer to the fee structure available on the
M1xchange TReDS Online
registration section.
