(i) Subject to the other provisions of the Scheme, the Trust undertakes, in relation
to credit facilities extended to an eligible borrower from time to time by an
eligible institution which has entered into the necessary agreement for this
purpose with the Trust, to provide a guarantee on account of the said credit
