for credit facility
1) Not exceeding ₹40 lakh for standalone coverage by GoTN (without
collaboration with CGTMSE)  under TNCGS with or without collateral
security and as follows when TNCGS collaborates with CGTMSE.
2) Not exceeding ₹500 lakh (Scheduled Commercial Banks, select Financial
Institutions, by way of term loan and/or working capital facilities on or after
entering into an agreement with the Trust, as may be revised by the Trust
from time to time.
