J0814,Q18,KYC directions for commercial banks,R-RBI-MD-012,"Reserve Bank of India (Commercial Banks - Capital Charge for Credit Risk – Standardised Approach) Directions, 2026",CHAPTER I – PRELIMINARY > 3. Scope,"3. Scope
