Regulation Act, 1949, section 10(2) read with section 18 of Payment and Settlement
Systems Act, 2007, section 11(1) of the Foreign Exchange Management Act, 1999, Rule
9(14) of Prevention of Money-Laundering (Maintenance of Records) Rules, 2005 and all
other enabling laws in this regard, the Reserve Bank being satisfied that it is necessary
and expedient in the public interest so to do, hereby issues the Amendment  Directions
hereinafter specified.3. Short Title and Commencement
(1) These Directions shall be called the Reser ve Bank of India (Commercial Banks –
Know Your Customer) Amendment Directions, 2025.
