Current Account
shall have the same meaning as defined in the
Reserve Bank of India (Commercial Banks – Interest Rate on Deposits) Directions, 2025
(9)
Customer
shall mean a user or a potential user of bank services and may include:
(i) a person or entity that maintains an account and / or has a business relationship with the bank;
(ii) one on whose behalf the account is maintained (i.e., the beneficial owner);
(iii) beneficiaries of transactions conducted by professional intermediaries, such as Stockbrokers, Chartered Accountants, Solicitors, etc., as permitted under the law, and
