under Section 42(2) of the Reserve Bank of India Act, 1934. The same shall be done
by including the amount of Participations, by the issuing bank under 'Borrowings from
banks' i.e. item l(b) in Form 'A'. The participating bank should include the amount of
Participations taken in advances to banks under item III(c) in Form 'A'. The amount of
Participations so included in the relative items of Form",,,,,,
