A.3.5 Other issues
56. The bank is free to decide on its promotional and product information displays. However, the mandatory displays may not be obstructed in any way. As customer interest and financial education are sought to be achieved by the mandatory display requirements, they should be given priority over the other display boards. Information relating to Government sponsored schemes, as applicable location-wise, may be displayed according to its applicability.
