instruments issued by NBFCs , it shall be guided by the instructions contained in
the Reserve Bank of India (Commercial Banks – Classification, Valuation and
Operation of Investment Portfolio) Directions, 2025.
233. For risk weights for bank credit to NBFCs, the bank’s exposure to NBFCs shall
be subject to capital charge as per the Risk Weight prescribed in Reserve Bank of
India (Commercial Banks – Prudential Norms on Capital Adequacy) Directions,
2025.
