DCCO)’ means the date on which the project is put to commercial use and
completion certificate / provisional completion certificate / occupancy
certificate (in case of CRE and CRE-RH projects) or its equivalent is issued
to the concessionaire / project developer / promoter.
(ii) ‘Annual Percentage Rate’ (APR) means APR as defined under Reserve
Bank of India (Commercial Banks - Responsible Business Conduct)
Directions, 2025.
(iii) ‘Appointed Date’ means the date, as defined in the concession agreement
