beverages sector; Companies which either belong to a different sector than mentioned in Kamath
committee or sector information is not available are mentioned as Not Mapped; MSMEs
categorized based on CMR as Super Prime: CMR-1 to CMR-3, Prime: CMR-4 to CMR-6 and
