J1138,Q25,benefits of Udyam registration,R-SANSAD-091,Lok Sabha Unstarred Q. 1892 (30 Jul 2026): Udyam Assist Portal,DR. MOHAMMAD JAWED:,"DR. MOHAMMAD JAWED:
Will the Minister of MICRO, SMALL AND MEDIUM ENTERPRISES be pleased to state:
(a) the details of enterprises registered under Udyam and Udyam Assist Portal since 2020 year -
wise and State/UT-wise;
(b)  the details of enterprises from the above registered base  that have availed benefits under any
Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises (MSME) scheme since 2020, year-wise and State/UT-wise;
(c)  the details of data systems, if any, being used to enable information convergence across MSME
schemes, including integration of Udyam registration data with scheme level databases; and
(d)  the reasons for the absence of a consolidated database on scheme uptake among registered
MSMEs and the steps being taken to address this gap?
(a): The Udyam Registration Portal (URP) was launched by Ministry of MSME on 01.07.2020
consequent upon revision of the definition of MSME classification vide notification S.O. 2119 (E)
dated 26.06.2020. U dyam Assist Portal (UAP) was launched on 11.01.2023. The Year -wise and
State/UT-wise number of enterprises registered on URP and UAP since 2020 till  30.06.2026 are at
Annexure-I.
(b) to (d):  The Year-wise and State/UT -wise details of the enterprises that have availed benefits
under major MSME schemes since 2020 till date are at Annexure – II for CGTMSE, Annexure – III
for PMEGP and  Annexure – IV for PM Vishwakarma . The Udyam Registration Porta l has API
Integration with 54 databases of different Ministries and Departments.
