lack of mandatory required documents such as Permanent Account Number (PAN) or Goods and
Tax
Identificat
ion Number (GSTIN)
, Udyam Assist Platform (UAP) was launched on 11.01.2023.
To
increase awareness about the benefits available through registration among MSMEs in the country
including States of Maharashtra and Gujarat, awareness programmes are conducted b
y the
field offices
