Integrate GeM with TReDS to enable information
sharing with financiers on government MSME
pur
chases, facilitating faster and cheaper credit.
iv
Introduce TReDS receivables as asset
backed securities to deepen the secondary market,
improve liquidity, and speed up settlements.Annexure
