providing for higher interest, and a timeline for conciliation
and arbitration. However, the basic provisions remain the
same and hence, what has been considered and held in
respect of provisions under the 1993 Act will hold good
in respect of the MSMED Act, unless a contrary intention
appears from the language of the MSMED Act.
