Circular No.158 / 2018–19
Charging of fee for using Search History module in system
As you are aware, search facility using ITPAN was introduced vide Circular No.
136/2017-18 dated December 19, 2017. The information on total exposure of the borrower
under CGTMSE and status of the account (NPA/Standard) were made available to the MLIs.
In this regard, it has been decided to charge a nominal fee of ₹50/- per successful
search for the information displayed in the search facility. The payment from MLI would
be collected monthly on 10th of the subsequent month.
The charge would be applicable with effect from November 19, 2018.
The contents of the circular may please be brought to the notice of all your offices.
(Y Venugopal Rao)
