Q1. What is the objective of SIDBI's Machinery Loan facility?
SIDBI's Machinery Loan facility is a form of MSME equipment finance that enables Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises (MSMEs) to acquire new machinery and equipment for setting up new unit, capacity expansion, modernisation and technology upgradation of existing units. Assistance is extended under the EXPRESS, SPEED and UDAY schemes.
Q2. What is the distinction between EXPRESS, SPEED and UDAY schemes?
The EXPRESS scheme
is a digitally assessed term loan facility targeted to existing entities with 3-year vintage, for the purchase of new machinery and equipment, with expeditious sanction.
The SIDBI SPEED scheme
is SIDBI's machinery finance scheme, targeted to existing entities with 3-year vintage for the purchase of equipment, with expeditious sanction.
The UDAY scheme
is SIDBI's machinery finance scheme targeted to new entities and existing entities having less than 3 years of vintage for purchase of new machinery and equipment, with expeditious sanction.
Q3. What quantum of assistance is available under these schemes?
EXPRESS:
up to ₹ 3 crore.
SPEED:
up to ₹ 15 crore.
UDAY:
up to ₹ 50 lakh.
Q4. Who is eligible to avail a Machinery Loan from SIDBI?
EXPRESS:
MSME units in operation for at least three years with mandatory GST registration.
SPEED:
MSME units in operation for at least three years with cash profit in last 3 FYs.
UDAY:
Greenfield/New MSME enterprise and existing MSME enterprise with less than 3 years of operations.
Q5. What is the repayment period applicable to Machinery Loans?EXPRESS / UDAY:
Repayment up to 60 months.
SPEED:
Repayment up to 84 months.
Q6. How can an enterprise apply for a Machinery Loan?
A machinery purchase loan for MSMEs can be applied online. Applications are submitted through the ""Apply Now"" option on the SIDBI website, which opens the Bank's online loan application portal. Enterprises that need assistance in filing the application may approach nearest SIDBI Branch Office or a Referral Partner registered with SIDBI. For queries, call the toll-free number
