Master Direction - Lending to Micro, Small & Medium Enterprises (MSME) Sector
The Reserve Bank of India has, from time to time, issued a number of instructions / guidelines to banks relating to lending to the Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises Sector. The
Master Direction
enclosed incorporates the updated instructions / guidelines on the subject. The list of circulars consolidated in this Master Direction is indicated in theAppendix
