J1756,Q39,negotiation conduct rules for lender fee waivers,R-RBI-HIST-610,"Reserve Bank of India (Trade Receivables Discounting System) Directions, 2026 (23 Jun 2026)",Chapter III – Conduct of Business > 14. Factoring units once accepted will have same sanctity and enforceability as,"instruments  or agreement in writing as provided under Negotiable
Instruments Act, 1881, and FRA.15. The platform shall ensure that participation related Master agreement includes
inter-alia the following stipulations:
