3.2.2 In this regard, Law Committee recommended that such applicants, who do not opt for
Authentication of Aadhar Number, may also be required to visit the GSK s for photo capturing and
document verification in order to ascertain the genuineness of such applicants  and their documents.
This will require an amendment in sub -rule (4A) of",,,,,,
